  "prefLabel": "Acp 103.02 Staff",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Acp 103.02 Staff. The board shall obtain staff assistants to perform its record keeping and other statutory functions, and to oversee the board's daily operations. The board shall designate an administrator who shall be responsible for maintaining all records of the board’s activities and for receiving correspondence, filings and other communications and documents.\n\nSource. #7080, eff 8-26-99",
